{"id":"69b5b67f3d7445d9","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code.md","title":"ZFC Recursive Polish Code","display":"df-zfc-recursive-polish-code — ZFC Recursive Polish Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code"],"display":"df-zfc-recursive-polish-code — ZFC Recursive Polish Code","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-analysis2-metric-completion]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursive-polish-code — ZFC Recursive Polish Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd77d1a968b64c37\" href=\"?note=cd77d1a968b64c37\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space\">58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"840ef0555c7aa179\" href=\"?note=840ef0555c7aa179\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-analysis2-metric-completion\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-analysis2-metric-completion</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> (recursive Polish-space code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (coded Polish space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,d,\\alpha\">\\(D,d,\\alpha\\)</span> (computable dense metric presentation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cd77d1a968b64c37\" href=\"?note=cd77d1a968b64c37\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space\">58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat d,i\">\\(\\widehat d,i\\)</span> (complete metric on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> and dense isometric embedding)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S\\)</span> (computable-metric-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MetricCompletion}\">\\(\\operatorname{MetricCompletion}\\)</span> (metric-completion predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"840ef0555c7aa179\" href=\"?note=840ef0555c7aa179\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-analysis2-metric-completion\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-analysis2-metric-completion</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePolishCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePolishCode}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}polish\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePolishCode}_S(c,X)\\leftrightarrow \\exists D,d,\\alpha,\\widehat d,i\\;\\bigl(c=\\langle D,d,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S(D,d,\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{MetricCompletion}(D,d;X,\\widehat d,i)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}polish\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePolishCode}_S(c,X)\\leftrightarrow \\exists D,d,\\alpha,\\widehat d,i\\;\\bigl(c=\\langle D,d,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S(D,d,\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{MetricCompletion}(D,d;X,\\widehat d,i)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Countability alone is not effectivity; the code includes a computable dense presentation and invokes the existing five-place completion predicate instead of an undefined completion operator and an untyped isomorphism sign.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space","status":"resolved","id":"cd77d1a968b64c37","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-analysis2-metric-completion","status":"resolved","id":"840ef0555c7aa179","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-analysis2-metric-completion]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space","status":"resolved","id":"cd77d1a968b64c37","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D,d,\\alpha$ (computable dense metric presentation, see [[58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-analysis2-metric-completion","status":"resolved","id":"840ef0555c7aa179","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{MetricCompletion}$ (metric-completion predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-analysis2-metric-completion]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"D,d,\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat d,i","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MetricCompletion}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePolishCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}polish\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePolishCode}_S(c,X)\\leftrightarrow \\exists D,d,\\alpha,\\widehat d,i\\;\\bigl(c=\\langle D,d,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S(D,d,\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{MetricCompletion}(D,d;X,\\widehat d,i)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1534,"backlinks":[{"id":"6c7e2c47ec8fa610","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePolishCode}_S$ (recursive-Polish-code predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3285","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code.md|58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","cd77d1a968b64c37","840ef0555c7aa179"]}